# Line endings (ADR-0007): every text file is LF in the index and in every checkout, whatever
# core.autocrlf says, so a Windows checkout, the wheel built from it and env.kit_sha256 are the same
# bytes as on Linux and macOS. Fixtures whose bytes are the expected value keep their own
# `* -text` (tests/fixtures/records/.gitattributes); do not remove it.
* text=auto eol=lf

